pxlogic-pxview (1.6.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package of PXView 1.6.5 (= upstream tag PXView_v1.6.5, current
    main branch) for Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute), built against the distribution
    Qt 6 instead of a separately installed Qt.
  * Packaging rewritten for this source tree: the inherited debian/ directory
    referenced Qt packages that do not exist (libqt6svg6-dev), carried a
    package version that never applied to PXView, and was missing mandatory
    dependencies of the current CMake build (Qt6 Svg/WebSockets/Multimedia
    and private headers, nlohmann-json3-dev, libzip-dev, nettle-dev,
    libftdi1-dev, sdcc).
  * Ship the Qt GUI (PXView), the headless daemon (pxviewd), the C protocol
    decoders and the bundled firmware (fx2lafw built from source), plus the
    udev rules and the desktop entry.
  * Do not install the libsigrok.a build artifact, which is linked into the
    binaries statically.

 -- PXLogic <913461865@qq.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:01:13 +0800
